{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17111","headline":"吴宫敎美人战 · 颜粲","name":"吴宫敎美人战","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有客陈兵画，功成欲霸吴。\n玉颜承将略，金钿指军符。\n转佩风云暗，鸣鼙锦绣趋。\n雪花频落粉，香汗尽流珠。\n掩笑谁干令，严刑必用诛。\n至今孙子术，犹可静边隅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"颜粲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17111.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17111","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}